00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:44,020
Find some mind-blowing moves at the latest Las Vegas attraction

375
00:31:44,021 --> 00:31:47,380
on the world's strongest stage elevator.

376
00:31:49,660 --> 00:31:53,360
The head tube of the specialized Demo 8 is so strong,

